{"parentUuid":"4e4f0647-e293-59ee-b2c6-fb4c3d43735e","isSidechain":false,"type":"assistant","uuid":"536d415d-10a0-54d3-93d4-0610d1703c31","timestamp":"2026-06-21T15:33:25.066Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/data/agent/choucisan","sessionId":"01bb0592-88b4-4599-936e-05490514a432","version":"mimo-claude-code-traces-1k","gitBranch":"HEAD","message":{"model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","id":"msg_536d415d10a054d393d40610","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to implement binary search on a rotated sorted array in Python and analyze its time and space complexity."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_4d2764e8b6944b1e8bd46a2f","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/data/agent/choucisan/rotated_binary_search.py","content":"def search(nums: list[int], target: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Search for target in a rotated sorted array. Returns index or -1.\"\"\"\n    lo, hi = 0, len(nums) - 1\n\n    while lo <= hi:\n        mid = (lo + hi) // 2\n        if nums[mid] == target:\n            return mid\n\n        # Left half is sorted\n        if nums[lo] <= nums[mid]:\n            if nums[lo] <= target < nums[mid]:\n                hi = mid - 1\n            else:\n                lo = mid + 1\n        # Right half is sorted\n        else:\n            if nums[mid] < target <= nums[hi]:\n                lo = mid + 1\n            else:\n                hi = mid - 1\n\n    return -1\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    tests = [\n        ([4, 5, 6, 7, 0, 1, 2], 0, 4),\n        ([4, 5, 6, 7, 0, 1, 2], 3, -1),\n        ([1], 0, -1),\n        ([1], 1, 0),\n        ([5, 1, 3], 5, 0),\n        ([3, 1], 1, 1),\n    ]\n    for nums, target, expected in tests:\n        result = search(nums, target)\n        status = \"PASS\" if result == expected else \"FAIL\"\n        print(f\"{status}: search({nums}, {target}) = {result}\")\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"in